  "schema_version": "2.0",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "apprehension, concern, fear, anxiety",
      "explanation": "A feeling of worry or concern about a potential negative outcome. More formal than {心配|しんぱい} and often used in written or official contexts."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "11862_kigu_ex1",
      "japanese": "{環境破壊|かんきょうはかい}が{危惧|きぐ}されている。",
      "english": "Environmental destruction is a cause for concern.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11862_kigu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{専門家|せんもんか}は{人口減少|じんこうげんしょう}に{危惧|きぐ}の{念|ねん}を{示|しめ}した。",
      "english": "The experts expressed concern about population decline.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "11862_kigu_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{動物|どうぶつ}は{絶滅|ぜつめつ}{危惧|きぐ}{種|しゅ}に{指定|してい}されている。",
      "english": "This animal is designated as an endangered species.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Also functions as a する verb ({危惧|きぐ}する — to fear, to be apprehensive about). Most commonly encountered in the compound {絶滅|ぜつめつ}{危惧|きぐ}{種|しゅ} (endangered species).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {危惧|きぐ}される — to be a cause for concern\n- {危惧|きぐ}の{念|ねん} — feelings of apprehension\n- {絶滅|ぜつめつ}{危惧|きぐ}{種|しゅ} — endangered species\n- {危惧|きぐ}を{抱|いだ}く — to harbor concerns\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {懸念|けねん} — concern, misgivings (also formal)\n- {心配|しんぱい} — worry (everyday, more casual)\n- {不安|ふあん} — anxiety, unease",
